  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Primary path · one bill scan",
      "items": [
        "ScanBill.jsx grabs a getUserMedia frame, then POSTs multipart billImage to /api/bills/scan",
        "Multer caps at 10 MB and allowlists .jpg .jpeg .png .webp by extension only — no MIME check (upload.js:23)",
        "sanitizeAndEnrichData normalises every AI field and sets warrantyStatus at a 30-day threshold"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Trust boundaries",
      "items": [
        "cors() is pinned to CLIENT_URL with httpOnly sameSite=lax cookies; authenticate() guards every bill route",
        "Ownership is enforced in the query — findByIdAndUserId and deleteByIdAndUserId both match userId",
        "Cloudinary egress is where bill images leave the boundary; without keys they stay in ./uploads"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Dependencies and deployment",
      "items": [
        "Strict two-step AI chain: Gemini first, host-local Ollama + Llava only on failure; both down throws",
        "Gmail OTP and all three OAuth strategies fall back to stdout logging and dummy_* credentials",
        "vercel.json rewrites /api/(.*) to backend/dist/api/index.js, which does not exist; there is no CI"
      ]
    }
  ]
